    "summary_insights": [
      "Revenue grew significantly by 23.6%, rising from £4.66m to £5.75m year-on-year.",
      "Gross profit increased by 20.0%, although the gross margin experienced a slight compression from 23.6% to 22.9%.",
      "Operating profit saw a robust 74.7% increase, driven by revenue growth outstripping the 12.2% rise in administrative overheads.",
      "Net profit improved by 34.6%, reaching £209,917, with the net margin remaining stable at approximately 3.6%.",
      "Interest coverage remains healthy at 4.89x, indicating the company comfortably services its debt obligations despite a 63.5% increase in interest costs.",
      "Subcontractor costs represent the largest single expense, accounting for over 50% of the total cost of sales in both years.",
      "The company maintained a consistent dividend policy, distributing £92,000 in 2022 compared to £90,000 in 2021."
